      "id": 1,
      "text": "Palmyra began as Carthage in 1836, then changed its name to Palmyra in 1839 to avoid confusion with another Indiana town.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        4,
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
